{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><figure><img src=\"https://cdn3.am730.com.hk/processed/2026-10/1061143/block/singleImage/3253251/df/01M65AX9H4J5KEX3YF9KS1NAQZ.jpg?updatedAt=1793328125\"/><figcaption>大圍秦石邨。（Google地圖截圖）</figcaption></figure><p>大圍發生懷疑猝死案。 昨日（29日）晚上11時許，一名35歲姓李男子與家人失去聯絡，家人懷疑他在沙田大圍秦石邨石玉樓住所暈倒，於是報警。警方和救援人員接報後趕至現場，發現他倒臥在單位內，經檢驗後，證實男子當場死亡，死因有待驗屍確定。警方正在調查事件。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-30T03:45:55.476270+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":144,"images":1,"source":"am730","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-30T02:42:05+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-30T09:18:58.774817+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-30T03:38:21.756541+00:00","content_hash":"b9a364111bc8c6ce727eb42ef01cdbc64d35a35d2f9e534ff9557208d09da551","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-10-30T03:45:55.476270+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}